        <mxCell id="note1" value="Observer (diagram 02) realised as publish–subscribe: the Enrollment Service publishes; the observers hosted here react independently (fork/join). A new recipient type is a new observer class — no change to enrolment logic (OCP, §6.4)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=#B09500;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
